{"id":"interesno","lemma":"интересно","pos":"adj","rank":310,"glosses":["it is interesting (to someone)","I wonder (introduces a clause)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Почему это интересно?","en":"Why is that interesting?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Интересно, от кого это?","en":"I wonder who this is from.","words":[null,{"g":"from"},{"g":"who","l":"кто"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Почему вам так интересно?","en":"Why are you so interested?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Интересно, кто это был.","en":"I wonder who it was.","words":[null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"}]},{"text":"Интересно, что это означает.","en":"I wonder what it means.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to mean, to signify","l":"означать"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"why"]]}]}